        For centuries, the maxim <em>"As Above, So Below"</em> has been diluted into a vague, poetic metaphor. In reality, it is a statement of hard, operative physics. It is the fundamental law of Sympathetic Resonance that governs the entire Enneagrammatic Escape Matrix.
      </p>
