        <ul style="color: var(--shsq-parchment); font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 0;">
          <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>The Tabula Smaragdina:</strong> The Emerald Tablet is not a philosophical treatise; it is an engineering schematic outlining the exact biological and psychological operations required to extract the immortal 'I' from the physical universe.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Fractal Architecture:</strong> The macrocosm (planetary spheres) is perfectly mirrored in the microcosm (the human nervous system).</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Separating the Subtle from the Gross:</strong> The application of conscious labor and intentional friction to separate one's true essence (Fire) from mechanical, culturally programmed reactions (Earth).</li>
